WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.701
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:04.167
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:05.167
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:06.434
According to a new poll,

00:00:06.434 --> 00:00:09.634
President Biden's approval
rating dropped to 39%.

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:11.534
But he's thinking
he can get that back up

00:00:11.534 --> 00:00:15.267
once he's indicted a few times.

00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:17.033
President Biden participated

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:18.834
in yesterday's
White House Demo Day,

00:00:18.834 --> 00:00:21.667
showcasing new technologies
from across the country,

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:24.701
and was way
too easily impressed.

00:00:24.701 --> 00:00:29.634
"Sir,
that's the office printer."

00:00:29.634 --> 00:00:32.534
"Look at this thing."

00:00:32.534 --> 00:00:34.701
Former President Trump
praised his daughter Ivanka

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:36.033
this morning ahead of her

00:00:36.033 --> 00:00:38.434
taking the witness stand
at his civil fraud trial

00:00:38.434 --> 00:00:40.701
and called her, "my wonderful
and beautiful daughter."

00:00:40.701 --> 00:00:42.434
Weird,
when his sons were testifying,

00:00:42.434 --> 00:00:44.300
he didn't have much
to say about them,

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.133
but now that it's Ivanka,
he's talking to her

00:00:46.133 --> 00:00:49.534
like she has medical power
of attorney over him.

00:00:49.534 --> 00:00:51.000
"My wonderful
and beautiful daughter

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.367
would never pull the plug
on her sick father.

00:00:53.367 --> 00:00:54.868
I could recover.

00:00:54.868 --> 00:00:58.501
A lot of people
are saying I could recover."

00:00:58.501 --> 00:01:00.400
Ahead of Ivanka Trump's
testimony today,

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.667
former President Trump
complained in a post

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:05.400
on Truth Social that the judge
and state prosecutors

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:07.801
were, "making me look bad."

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:09.601
And then he sprayed
his face bronze,

00:01:09.601 --> 00:01:11.901
combed his ear hair
to the center of his head,

00:01:11.901 --> 00:01:13.701
yanked his tie down
to his knees,

00:01:13.701 --> 00:01:17.167
and left the house for the day.

00:01:17.167 --> 00:01:18.601
During a hearing yesterday

00:01:18.601 --> 00:01:21.501
of the UK's official
coronavirus inquiry,

00:01:21.501 --> 00:01:22.801
a former aide said

00:01:22.801 --> 00:01:24.734
that then-Prime Minister
Boris Johnson

00:01:24.734 --> 00:01:26.501
had asked at the start
of the pandemic

00:01:26.501 --> 00:01:30.067
to be injected with Covid-19
live on television.

00:01:30.067 --> 00:01:32.167
Way too risky,
said his advisers,

00:01:32.167 --> 00:01:35.934
about putting him
live on television.

00:01:35.934 --> 00:01:40.400
The Boris Johnson photo
just getting laughs.

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:41.767
Just getting laughs.

00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:43.367
It's good every now
and then when you go,

00:01:43.367 --> 00:01:46.467
"Yeah, we're not the only one
who had one of those."

00:01:46.467 --> 00:01:50.267
They had -- Other people
had one of those.

00:01:50.267 --> 00:01:52.434
Texas Senator Ted Cruz
said in a new interview

00:01:52.434 --> 00:01:54.734
that he plans to run
for president again someday

00:01:54.734 --> 00:01:57.734
and added, "I loved
running for president in 2016.

00:01:57.734 --> 00:01:59.267
We came incredibly close.

00:01:59.267 --> 00:02:01.033
We came within inches
of winning."

00:02:01.033 --> 00:02:03.067
I guess in the same way
that the moon

00:02:03.067 --> 00:02:07.367
is within 16 billion inches
of the Earth.

00:02:07.367 --> 00:02:10.067
Texas Senator Ted Cruz released
his new book yesterday titled,

00:02:10.067 --> 00:02:13.734
"Unwoke" How to Defeat
Cultural Marxism in America."

00:02:13.734 --> 00:02:15.100
And if you really want
to be unwoke,

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:17.834
he also reads the audiobook.

00:02:17.834 --> 00:02:21.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.634 --> 00:02:23.167
New York Mets owner Steve Cohen

00:02:23.167 --> 00:02:25.567
yesterday unveiled his plans
for a new casino,

00:02:25.567 --> 00:02:28.033
hotel, and music venue
near Citi Field,

00:02:28.033 --> 00:02:30.434
which is expected
to cost $8 billion,

00:02:30.434 --> 00:02:33.100
or roughly $1 billion
times as much as

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:35.434
the average Mets ticket
in September.

00:02:35.434 --> 00:02:39.434
So much math in that joke.

00:02:39.434 --> 00:02:44.267
Not just math,
but then calendar.

00:02:44.267 --> 00:02:46.200
To get that punch line,
you had to do math,

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:51.100
then you had to do calendar,
then you had to do baseball.

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:54.501
I can't believe it went
as well as it did.

00:02:54.501 --> 00:02:56.100
"People" magazine
announced yesterday

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:58.400
that it has named actor
Patrick Dempsey

00:02:58.400 --> 00:02:59.868
The Sexiest Man Alive.

00:02:59.868 --> 00:03:01.334
[ Cheers ]

00:03:01.334 --> 00:03:03.834
You guys know we were
only supposed to set our clocks

00:03:03.834 --> 00:03:05.868
back one hour, right?

00:03:12.167 --> 00:03:14.634
I will say,
I read that joke first,

00:03:14.634 --> 00:03:16.868
and then I saw a picture
and I'm like,

00:03:16.868 --> 00:03:20.067
"Pretty [bleep] sexy."

00:03:20.067 --> 00:03:22.834
I'm not complaining
about the pick.

00:03:22.834 --> 00:03:26.467
And finally, three pandas from
the Smithsonian National Zoo

00:03:26.467 --> 00:03:27.767
were returned to China today,

00:03:27.767 --> 00:03:30.400
packed in a special crate
on a FedEx plane --

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:32.501
or as Southwest calls it,
Economy Plus.

00:03:32.501 --> 00:03:35.634
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

